{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mazestalker: The Veil of Silenos",
    "steam_appid": 3218310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/1d5b20b7a0b66c9d2bf9a09f1e1b59ec.poster.avif?t=1747599104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/1d5b20b7a0b66c9d2bf9a09f1e1b59ec.webm?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/1d5b20b7a0b66c9d2bf9a09f1e1b59ec.mp4?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The adventure of a lifetime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/52b9f62cd865ae0bdf00f01d2dd80acf.poster.avif?t=1747599104\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/52b9f62cd865ae0bdf00f01d2dd80acf.webm?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/52b9f62cd865ae0bdf00f01d2dd80acf.mp4?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the ever curious explorer <strong>Yve Allard</strong> and explore isometric dungeon labyrinths from a time when videogames were filled with handcrafted environments and every moment resonant with wonder and joy. Hidden secrets and deadly traps await curious explorers in the darkest corners of the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture into the unkown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/b69cce0cae1ed7a2349a18b020dc5f6d.poster.avif?t=1747599104\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/b69cce0cae1ed7a2349a18b020dc5f6d.webm?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/b69cce0cae1ed7a2349a18b020dc5f6d.mp4?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of Platforming, Combat and Puzzle-solving comes together to create a retro-vibe that strikes a deep chord within the childlike part of every gamer. Discover the mysterious world of Ebuzond, filled with ancient mysteries and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted dungeon labyrinths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful overworld filled with secret discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sega Genesis inspired 16-Bit Retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich story full of heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique treasures to collect</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/1d5b20b7a0b66c9d2bf9a09f1e1b59ec.poster.avif?t=1747599104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/1d5b20b7a0b66c9d2bf9a09f1e1b59ec.webm?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/1d5b20b7a0b66c9d2bf9a09f1e1b59ec.mp4?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The adventure of a lifetime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/52b9f62cd865ae0bdf00f01d2dd80acf.poster.avif?t=1747599104\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/52b9f62cd865ae0bdf00f01d2dd80acf.webm?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/52b9f62cd865ae0bdf00f01d2dd80acf.mp4?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the ever curious explorer <strong>Yve Allard</strong> and explore isometric dungeon labyrinths from a time when videogames were filled with handcrafted environments and every moment resonant with wonder and joy. Hidden secrets and deadly traps await curious explorers in the darkest corners of the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture into the unkown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/b69cce0cae1ed7a2349a18b020dc5f6d.poster.avif?t=1747599104\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/b69cce0cae1ed7a2349a18b020dc5f6d.webm?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218310/extras/b69cce0cae1ed7a2349a18b020dc5f6d.mp4?t=1747599104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of Platforming, Combat and Puzzle-solving comes together to create a retro-vibe that strikes a deep chord within the childlike part of every gamer. Discover the mysterious world of Ebuzond, filled with ancient mysteries and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted dungeon labyrinths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful overworld filled with secret discoveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sega Genesis inspired 16-Bit Retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich story full of heart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique treasures to collect</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover a world of Escher-like isometric dungeon-labyrinths. Meet Yve Allard, a treasure hunter who finds that all corners of the world have already been visited by someone else. Where in the world can you discover new mysteries anymore?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
